        "jsCode": "// Map to the shape 'Merge | Add Drive Links' expects (a bare webViewLink)\n// -- the item still carries the original file_name/binary fields from\n// 'Pick Exact Attachment Match', which aren't needed on this skip-upload\n// path and are intentionally dropped here.\nreturn $input.all().map(item => ({\n  json: { webViewLink: item.json._existingFileWebViewLink },\n  pairedItem: item.pairedItem\n}));"
